{"4342420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Brew Simulator", "steam_appid": 4342420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALCOHOL IS ILLEGAL. DEMAND ISN’T.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, producing and selling alcohol is against the law — but people haven’t stopped drinking. Start with a small house and an old moonshine still, find your first customers, and turn a hidden operation into a full-blown criminal empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREW, EXPERIMENT, AND EXPAND PRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ingredients, control the brewing process, temperature, and drink quality. Experiment with recipes and create alcohol with different properties and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new ingredients and equipment, expand your product range, and grow from small-scale home brewing into advanced drinks and automated production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/3a0ac833a2bc90a735a39e191480c71b.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/3a0ac833a2bc90a735a39e191480c71b.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/3a0ac833a2bc90a735a39e191480c71b.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND CUSTOMERS AND BUILD YOUR SALES NETWORK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the city’s residents, hand out samples, and turn random buyers into loyal customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, make deals, and learn what people like — not every drink will suit every customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/787f1273c2076c2eb3485ce63f62fb7e.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/787f1273c2076c2eb3485ce63f62fb7e.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/787f1273c2076c2eb3485ce63f62fb7e.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE OVER DISTRICTS AND BUILD YOUR OWN GANG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for influence points, push out rival groups, and take control of entire districts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire people, grow your own gang, and send your crew to defend your territory from competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/24646d0f38750c8cd73c8a874d545ef7.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/24646d0f38750c8cd73c8a874d545ef7.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/24646d0f38750c8cd73c8a874d545ef7.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STAY AHEAD OF THE POLICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An illegal business attracts police attention. The more serious your crimes become, the higher your wanted level rises — from routine checks to full-scale chases and arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you’ll have to dump the product, abandon your vehicle, and disappear before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/5619a8daa8a279ee7cce7c33219eb97f.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/5619a8daa8a279ee7cce7c33219eb97f.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/5619a8daa8a279ee7cce7c33219eb97f.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE CITY AND EXPAND YOUR EMPIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different districts, discover customers, useful locations, and underground establishments. The city’s residents follow their own routines, work, walk the streets, and react to what happens around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy property, upgrade your production bases, and purchase vehicles. Open your own underground bar, sell alcohol there, hire employees, and interact with customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand into new businesses — buy vineyards, establish wine production, and grow your alcohol empire far beyond home brewing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience, develop your skills, and unlock new ingredients, equipment, products, and opportunities as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/c00ec324a1ce531a55f124972d952d68.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/c00ec324a1ce531a55f124972d952d68.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/c00ec324a1ce531a55f124972d952d68.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your underground empire alone or together with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split the work: produce alcohol, find customers, transport goods, manage businesses, explore the city, and fight for control of its territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/4153143453732c1c804cd542aa16ad20.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/4153143453732c1c804cd542aa16ad20.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/4153143453732c1c804cd542aa16ad20.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world divided into districts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed alcohol production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different recipes, ingredients, quality levels, and drink effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression from home brewing to automated production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills, character progression, and new unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers with their own preferences and orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory control and rival criminal groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your own crew and district defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police, wanted levels, inspections, and chases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Property, vehicles, and business expansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your own underground bar with employees and customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vineyards and wine production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground locations and hidden establishments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative multiplayer</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALCOHOL IS ILLEGAL. DEMAND ISN’T.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, producing and selling alcohol is against the law — but people haven’t stopped drinking. Start with a small house and an old moonshine still, find your first customers, and turn a hidden operation into a full-blown criminal empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREW, EXPERIMENT, AND EXPAND PRODUCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ingredients, control the brewing process, temperature, and drink quality. Experiment with recipes and create alcohol with different properties and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new ingredients and equipment, expand your product range, and grow from small-scale home brewing into advanced drinks and automated production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/3a0ac833a2bc90a735a39e191480c71b.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/3a0ac833a2bc90a735a39e191480c71b.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/3a0ac833a2bc90a735a39e191480c71b.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND CUSTOMERS AND BUILD YOUR SALES NETWORK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the city’s residents, hand out samples, and turn random buyers into loyal customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, make deals, and learn what people like — not every drink will suit every customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/787f1273c2076c2eb3485ce63f62fb7e.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/787f1273c2076c2eb3485ce63f62fb7e.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/787f1273c2076c2eb3485ce63f62fb7e.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE OVER DISTRICTS AND BUILD YOUR OWN GANG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for influence points, push out rival groups, and take control of entire districts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire people, grow your own gang, and send your crew to defend your territory from competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/24646d0f38750c8cd73c8a874d545ef7.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/24646d0f38750c8cd73c8a874d545ef7.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/24646d0f38750c8cd73c8a874d545ef7.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STAY AHEAD OF THE POLICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An illegal business attracts police attention. The more serious your crimes become, the higher your wanted level rises — from routine checks to full-scale chases and arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you’ll have to dump the product, abandon your vehicle, and disappear before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra