c324a1ce531a55f124972d952d68.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your underground empire alone or together with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split the work: produce alcohol, find customers, transport goods, manage businesses, explore the city, and fight for control of its territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/4153143453732c1c804cd542aa16ad20.poster.avif?t=1787566561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/4153143453732c1c804cd542aa16ad20.webm?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/extras/4153143453732c1c804cd542aa16ad20.mp4?t=1787566561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world divided into districts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed alcohol production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different recipes, ingredients, quality levels, and drink effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression from home brewing to automated production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills, character progression, and new unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers with their own preferences and orders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory control and rival criminal groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your own crew and district defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police, wanted levels, inspections, and chases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Property, vehicles, and business expansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your own underground bar with employees and customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vineyards and wine production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground locations and hidden establishments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative multiplayer</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "An open world where alcohol is illegal. Produce and sell it, find customers, take over territories, grow your gang, and build a criminal empire — alone or with friends.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/916c88b6b3be14513228faaf095294ed361265e1/header.jpg?t=1787566561", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/ba7db633e1fdefcf4467e4b457ed1ec53c30385b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787566561", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4342420/ba7db633e1fdefcf4467e4b457ed1ec53c30385b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787566561", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6 GB) / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires SSD for stable performance</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K / AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 